  const base=k==='mirror'?C.arrow:k==='move'?C.tree:null,target=k==='mirror'?C.mirror(C.arrow):k==='move'?C.shiftRight(C.tree):C.diamond;
  h+=instruction(k==='mirror'?'MIRROR':k==='move'?'MOVE':'CONVERT',k==='mirror'?'Make the arrow face the opposite way. Reverse the pixel order in every row.':k==='move'?'Move every black pixel one column right. Keep the leftmost column white. Do not wrap pixels around the edge.':'Each row’s score is an eight-bit number. Convert the score to bits, then use those bits as pixel colours.',k==='mirror'?'让箭头朝向相反方向，把每一行的像素顺序反过来。':k==='move'?'把每个黑色像素向右移动一列，最左列保持白色。不要把边缘像素绕到另一边。':'每行分数都是一个八位二进制数。先把分数变成二进制，再把二进制变成像素。');
